what The weave head says a Place is run, then site, then position, and Place.less_than reads run, site, ord, pos -- four keys since ord landed at %680. The %773 repair read the Diff list and two behavior passages and missed this one, because the guard reads LISTS and this claim is a SENTENCE. Write Place's fields as a head enumeration and gate it against the struct both ways, as Diff now is, so the ordering claim becomes readable by an instrument.
